  "description": "The trail is your canvas, and its lines are merely suggestions. Designed for the out of bounds and the out of play, the Offering is here to open up lines you didn't know you had in you. With a compliant, chassis-tuned frame, ride altering geometry, and exciting new features, the Offering is an experience far greater than numbers - a true extension of self. The trail won't know what hit it.\n\nThough the Offering retains its moniker, it's a completely new generation of what a mountain bike can be - everything has changed. We can spew out numbers and charts for you to compare with other bikes, but that is where the numbers leave the chat and a unique experience takes the stage. Dave Weagle sweated every detail to bring you the latest incarnation of Evil Bikes and the DELTA System. The bike you never knew you needed is the only bike you'll ever need to have.\n\nLEARN MORE ABOUT THE 2026 OFFERING\n\nDEMO BEFORE YOU BUY\n\nNOW SHIPPING!",
